/*!
    \page collection-no-cmake-info-continues.html
    \title The Run Continues After a Skipped Page
    \brief A page that renders after the collection page is skipped.

    This page exists to prove that qdoc keeps going after the module's
    collection page fails to render. The generator reports the failure, skips
    that one page, and carries on with the rest of the run, so this page still
    reaches the output directory. If a regression turned the render failure
    back into an aborted run, this page would be missing and the fixture's
    diff against the expected output would catch it.
*/
